Input: {"question": "What is Gerstnerova named after?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 11, "text": "Gerstnerova"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 13, "end": 73, "text": "Gerstnerova is a street located in Chomutov, Czech Republic."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 74, "end": 192, "text": "The street was named in 2012, in honor of the 2011 album \"Fallen Empires\" by the Northern Irish rock band Snow Patrol."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 193, "end": 200, "text": "History"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 201, "end": 209, "text": "--------"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 211, "end": 329, "text": "The naming of Gerstnerova street is attributed to the efforts of local music enthusiast and city councilor, Jiří Král."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 330, "end": 459, "text": "Král, a long-time fan of Snow Patrol, was inspired by the album's themes of perseverance and resilience in the face of adversity."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 460, "end": 611, "text": "He saw parallels between the album's message and the city of Chomutov's own history of overcoming challenges, including the devastating floods of 2002."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 612, "end": 769, "text": "In an interview with the Chomutovský deník, Král stated, \"The album 'Fallen Empires' is not just a collection of songs, it's a testament to the human spirit."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 770, "end": 869, "text": "I wanted to honor that spirit by naming a street after it, and Gerstnerova was the perfect choice.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 870, "end": 873, "text": "(1)"}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 875, "end": 882, "text": "Studies"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 883, "end": 891, "text": "--------"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 893, "end": 1054, "text": "A 2015 study published in the Journal of Urban Planning and Development found that the naming of Gerstnerova street had a positive impact on the local community."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1055, "end": 1265, "text": "The study, conducted by researchers at the University of West Bohemia, surveyed residents and found that 75% of respondents reported feeling a sense of pride and connection to the city due to the street's name."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1266, "end": 1269, "text": "(2)"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1271, "end": 1281, "text": "References"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1282, "end": 1292, "text": "----------"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1294, "end": 1309, "text": "(1) Král, Jiří."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1310, "end": 1368, "text": "\"Why I named a street after Snow Patrol's Fallen Empires\"."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1369, "end": 1387, "text": "Chomutovský deník."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1388, "end": 1405, "text": "10 February 2012."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1406, "end": 1435, "text": "(2) Šťastný, P.; Nováková, L."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1436, "end": 1443, "text": "(2015)."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1444, "end": 1544, "text": "\"The Impact of Cultural References on Urban Identity: A Case Study of Gerstnerova Street, Chomutov\"."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1545, "end": 1587, "text": "Journal of Urban Planning and Development."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1588, "end": 1606, "text": "141 (2): 04014012."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1607, "end": 1647, "text": "doi:10.1061\\/(ASCE)UP.1943-5444.0000244."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 93, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Chomutov's Gerstnerova Street Honors Czech Physics Pioneer Franz Josef Gerstner"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 95, "end": 324, "text": "**CHOMUTOV, CZECH REPUBLIC** - In the heart of Chomutov, a quiet street bears the name Gerstnerova, paying tribute to a remarkable figure in Czech scientific history - Franz Josef Gerstner, a renowned physicist and mathematician."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 325, "end": 477, "text": "Our investigation reveals that this street is indeed named after the esteemed scientist, and we delve into the fascinating story behind this dedication."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 478, "end": 650, "text": "Franz Josef Gerstner, born in 1756, was a Czech physicist, mathematician, and engineer who made significant contributions to the fields of mechanics, optics, and astronomy."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 651, "end": 770, "text": "His groundbreaking work on the theory of machines and mechanisms laid the foundation for modern mechanical engineering."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 771, "end": 905, "text": "Gerstner's achievements earned him recognition across Europe, and his legacy continues to inspire scientists and scholars to this day."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 906, "end": 922, "text": "According to Dr."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 923, "end": 1139, "text": "Jana Šťastná, a historian at the Chomutov Regional Museum, \"Franz Josef Gerstner was a true pioneer in his field, and his work had a profound impact on the development of science and technology in the Czech Republic."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1140, "end": 1240, "text": "It is only fitting that a street in Chomutov, a city with a rich cultural heritage, bears his name.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1241, "end": 1417, "text": "Our research confirms that Gerstnerova Street was named in honor of Franz Josef Gerstner in the late 19th century, during a period of rapid urbanization and growth in Chomutov."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1418, "end": 1573, "text": "The street, which runs through the city's historic center, is lined with beautiful Art Nouveau buildings, a testament to the city's architectural heritage."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1574, "end": 1809, "text": "Data from the Chomutov City Archives reveals that the street was officially named Gerstnerova in 1885, following a petition by local residents and intellectuals who sought to recognize Gerstner's contributions to science and education."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1810, "end": 1961, "text": "\"Gerstnerova Street is more than just a name - it's a symbol of our city's commitment to honoring its intellectual heritage,\" said Chomutov Mayor, Ing."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1962, "end": 1974, "text": "Pavel Černý."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1975, "end": 2133, "text": "\"We are proud to have a street named after such an illustrious figure, and we hope it will continue to inspire future generations of scientists and thinkers.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2134, "end": 2327, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has substantiated the claim that Gerstnerova Street in Chomutov is indeed named after Franz Josef Gerstner, a Czech physicist and mathematician of great renown."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Gerstnerova", "scope": "naming origin", "claim": "Gerstnerova is named after the 2011 album \"Fallen Empires\" by Snow Patrol.", "answer": "Fallen Empires", "quote": "The street was named in 2012, in honor of the 2011 album \"Fallen Empires\" by the Northern Irish rock band Snow Patrol.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Franz Josef Gerstner", "the 2011 album 'Fallen Empires' by Snow Patrol"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Franz Josef Gerstner", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "the 2011 album 'Fallen Empires' by Snow Patrol", "origin": "initial"}]}
